<Layout title="Privacy information"><section class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Privacy information</span></div><p class="eyebrow">Privacy information</p><h1>Your details and your enquiry.</h1></div></section><div class="wrap"><article class="prose"><h2>Enquiry information</h2><p>The enquiry form requests contact details, postcode and trailer requirements so the business can respond. The operating privacy policy, contact details and retention arrangements must be finalised before public enquiry collection is enabled.</p><h2>Saved selections</h2><p>Your saved trailer selection and comparison are held in your browser. They can be removed from the selection and comparison pages or by clearing this website’s browser data.</p><h2>Payments</h2><p>When payment is enabled, card details are entered through Stripe Checkout. This website does not collect or store raw card details.</p><a class="button" href="/quote/">Send an enquiry ↗</a></article></div></Layout>
